WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.501
♪

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.503
I miss you so much.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.046
I miss you too Momma.

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.506
Alice: Will you be careful out there?

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:07.716
Always. 

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.843
♪

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.095
♪

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:15.974
♪

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:19.686
♪

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.353
Mummy!

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.146
♪

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.022
Jo: I’m very happy to be back home.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:25.567
♪

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.943
Jo: But things are different.

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:29.988
♪

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.156
Jo: I have a piano in my house

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.073
♪

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:33.867
Jo: And I don’t play the piano. 

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.202
♪

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.871
Jenny: Do you have hallucinations?

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.788
Alice: Momma?

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:41.791
♪

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.250
Yeah.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.961
♪

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:48.089
Henry: Astronauts go through things they don’t understand.

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.674
That’s when people come unstuck.

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:51.593
♪

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.677
Jo: When I was up there,

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:53.970
Jo: the only thing I could focus on

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.847
Jo: was getting back to my daughter.

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:56.639
♪

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.892
Alice: I miss you mummy, will you be careful up there?

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.143
Alice: Mummy who was that?

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.187
Jo: That was you and me right before the accident.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:05.565
♪

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.649
That was not me.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:09.152
♪

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:09.569
Momma?

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.195
♪

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:11.738
Where is she?

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:12.655
Who?

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:17.952
♪

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:18.828
You!

00:01:18.828 --> 00:01:20.663
♪

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:23.374
Henry: I invented a machine we took into space.

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:24.334
And I saw something.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.337
Henry: But it seems like it doesn’t want to be seen.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:29.005
♪

00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:31.007
Irena: People see things up there.

00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:31.883
♪

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:34.427
Irena: And when they get back they go crazy.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.970
♪

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.889
This isn’t madness!

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:42.519
♪

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:43.686
Jo: You need to help me!

00:01:43.686 --> 00:01:46.898
♪

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.691
Jo: I need to go back to her.

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:53.404
♪

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:54.864
Jo: Do I seem the same to you?

00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:58.785
♪

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.162
I just don’t feel like you’re my mum.

00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:09.546
♪

